          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumi wakusambila wudi neyi mutupa, mumi wamuchiyedi wudi neyi mwana kaŋombi, mumi wamuchisatu wudi namesu neyi amuntu, mumi wamuchiwana wudi neyi mbuulu wukutúuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa amomi awana akweti mpuula, iwu jitanu nayimu, iwu jitanu nayimu, muyawana wawu; ela kwamesu hohu hejima kwi-ndo nimukachi. Nimwaana niwufuku; hiyanookaŋaku nakwila nawu, Wajila! Wajila! Wajila! Yehova Nzambi Watwesha yejima, wadiŋi kwoku, wekala kwoku, wamba kenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa amomi chakutiyakeshawu kulema nimpuhu nakusakilila washakama hetanda, wahandaŋa haya nyaka nanyaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awa awakulumpi makumi ayedi nawana hiyakudinata hamaseki kunyendu yanowu washakama hetanda dawanta, nakudifukula kudi yena wahandaŋa haya nyaka nanyaka. Hiyakunatila yibaaba yawu kumesu etanda dawanta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakwila nawu, Eyi Yehova wetu, eyi Nzambi yetu, wunateli kutambula kulema nimpuhu niŋovu. Muloŋa yeyi waleŋeli yuma yejima kulonda yili mwaya muchima weyi; dichi chiyekala, dichi chayileŋeluwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
